WEBVTT

00:00.440 --> 00:03.080
Syrup! [Spirit Cannon]!

00:03.080 --> 00:04.440
Turtle!

00:09.440 --> 00:12.900
Red Flower Garden

00:09.440 --> 00:12.900
Damage taken by anything within its range is increased by 5%

00:09.440 --> 00:12.900
Conditions for Acquisition

00:09.440 --> 00:12.900
Acquired upon leveling up.

00:09.440 --> 00:12.900
What do we have here? [Red Flower Garden]?

00:12.900 --> 00:16.690
Yay! Evolving gets you a 
bunch of new skills, too!

00:16.690 --> 00:18.290
That's my Syrup!

00:18.290 --> 00:19.370
Turtle...

00:19.620 --> 00:21.700
These tentacles are really easy to use, too.

00:22.060 --> 00:24.490
Let's keep working hard to level up!

00:26.170 --> 00:28.300
I thought it seemed awfully noisy over here.

00:28.300 --> 00:29.880
So it was you, Maple.

00:29.880 --> 00:34.080
Whoa, you really do have 
tentacles. How'd that happen?

00:34.080 --> 00:38.410
If Mii hadn't warned us, we might've thought 
you were a monster and cut 'em off.

00:38.410 --> 00:40.270
You guys are from Flame Emperors...

00:42.330 --> 00:51.150
<b>BOFURI: </b>I <b>Don't Want </b>to <b>Get Hurt,
</b>so I'll <b>Max Out My Defense</b>.

02:09.190 --> 02:10.980
<b>BOFURI: </b>I <b>Don't Want </b>to <b>Get Hurt,
</b>so I'll <b>Max Out My Defense</b>.

02:11.670 --> 02:16.340
<b>Maxing Defense </b>and <b>the Eighth Event</b>.

02:14.830 --> 02:16.630
Um... is something wrong?

02:16.630 --> 02:18.790
Yo, does this thing look different now?

02:18.790 --> 02:22.120
Oh! You can tell? Yeah, it's an ev—

02:23.110 --> 02:25.410
I'm not at liberty to reveal all the details.

02:25.410 --> 02:29.300
Well, it's wiser to not give 
away information too readily.

02:29.300 --> 02:30.980
Especially right before an event.

02:30.980 --> 02:33.630
So you were working on leveling Syrup up?

02:33.630 --> 02:35.770
Yeah! You guys, too?

02:35.770 --> 02:39.150
Yeah. Curious about our tame monsters?

02:39.150 --> 02:39.970
Yes!

02:39.970 --> 02:44.730
Hmm... Well, we've already seen yours, so...

02:44.730 --> 02:46.700
I guess we can show you.

02:46.700 --> 02:47.350
[Awaken]!

02:51.250 --> 02:54.130
This is my partner, Wen.

02:54.130 --> 02:56.070
Well? Pretty cool-looking, ain't he?

02:56.070 --> 02:58.250
Yeah! He looks super cool!

02:58.250 --> 03:02.000
Well, that makes me glad I showed him to you.

03:02.000 --> 03:03.800
You just wanted to show him off.

03:05.150 --> 03:06.790
Well, yeah. That, too.

03:06.790 --> 03:08.490
What about you guys?

03:10.600 --> 03:12.040
Do you think we should, Misery?

03:12.040 --> 03:15.170
I don't see any problem 
with just showing her.

03:15.510 --> 03:16.350
Well, then...

03:16.350 --> 03:17.570
[Awaken]!

03:23.150 --> 03:26.060
Aww! They're both so cute!

03:28.310 --> 03:31.490
I'm sorry. Bell is a bit shy with strangers.

03:31.490 --> 03:34.510
And don't do anything 
weird to my Clear, either.

03:35.390 --> 03:37.320
I-I won't!

03:37.570 --> 03:39.940
Okay, well, I guess that's it for today.

03:40.200 --> 03:42.820
Thank you for showing me your companions.

03:42.820 --> 03:46.100
Yeah, but we might end up being 
enemies in the next event, y'know.

03:46.100 --> 03:50.470
Next time, you'll have to introduce 
all the monsters in Maple Tree to us.

03:50.470 --> 03:51.540
Bye.

03:51.540 --> 03:52.650
Sure!

03:55.150 --> 03:57.170
I guess there are all kinds of monsters.

03:57.170 --> 03:58.960
Turtle...

03:59.700 --> 04:01.420
Rawr!

04:01.420 --> 04:03.270
Everyone, the wait is over!

04:03.270 --> 04:07.640
I will now explain the rules 
of the eighth event in detail!

04:09.350 --> 04:09.870
<b>8th Event</b>

04:09.710 --> 04:11.080
As I told you last time,

04:11.080 --> 04:12.470
<b>Preliminary</b>

04:11.080 --> 04:15.000
this event will be divided into 
a preliminary and a main event.

04:12.470 --> 04:14.880
<b>Preliminary</b>

04:12.910 --> 04:15.000
<b>Main Event</b>

04:14.920 --> 04:16.880
<b>Preliminary</b>

04:15.000 --> 04:17.220
The preliminary will be a survival match.

04:15.710 --> 04:16.880
<b>Survival</b>

04:17.220 --> 04:21.110
You'll get points based on how long you 
survive and how many monsters you defeat.

04:21.590 --> 04:23.080
The points you earn

04:23.080 --> 04:27.080
will determine the difficulty level 
you can play in the main event.

04:27.080 --> 04:31.820
So it comes down to how many monsters 
you can kill before your first death?

04:31.820 --> 04:35.420
Considering the bonus for staying 
alive, you can't afford to die at all.

04:35.420 --> 04:40.130
For added fun, there'll be some little 
gimmicks in store when you defeat monsters!

04:40.430 --> 04:44.040
So we can't let our guard down 
even after the enemy falls, then?

04:44.040 --> 04:45.890
I wonder what kinds of gimmicks they'll be.

04:45.890 --> 04:47.970
I like it. Sounds fun.

04:47.970 --> 04:51.480
Players are free to assist or 
obstruct each other as they like,

04:51.480 --> 04:53.330
but be aware that only the one

04:53.330 --> 04:56.940
who deals the final blow to a 
monster will get the points.

04:56.940 --> 04:59.260
I hope we'll be able to join up.

04:59.260 --> 05:02.150
Yeah. We're way too slow on our own.

05:02.150 --> 05:04.720
I'll explain how the main 
event will work later.

05:04.720 --> 05:09.090
Be sure to make all your preparations 
before the preliminary starts!

05:09.090 --> 05:12.160
Bye now! Rawr!

05:12.810 --> 05:16.370
So, what's our goal, Guildmaster?

05:16.370 --> 05:19.990
For all eight of us to make it to 
the highest difficulty, of course!

05:19.990 --> 05:22.510
Just like always, let's 
work hard at leveling up

05:22.510 --> 05:24.470
and win our way through the preliminary!

05:24.470 --> 05:26.680
Yeah!

05:38.750 --> 05:40.380
Bear! Bear!

05:45.710 --> 05:48.660
Bear! Bear! Bear!

05:56.540 --> 05:59.250
Bear! Bear!

06:08.500 --> 06:10.260
Rawr!

06:10.260 --> 06:14.600
Okay, it's time to begin the preliminary 
round of the eighth event!

06:14.600 --> 06:17.060
Are you all ready for adventure?

06:17.340 --> 06:19.020
Let's all do our best!

06:19.020 --> 06:20.020
Fight!

06:20.490 --> 06:22.770
Yeah!

06:22.770 --> 06:26.250
Let the event begin!

06:36.090 --> 06:38.660
Doesn't look like there's anyone around.

06:38.660 --> 06:41.930
Okay! Gotta start looking for monsters!

06:41.930 --> 06:44.270
First of all... [Predator]!

06:45.010 --> 06:46.840
Wonder if there's anything around.

06:53.260 --> 06:54.680
[Paralyze Shot]!

06:58.780 --> 07:01.850
It looks strong. I'd 
better use [Devour], too.

07:08.060 --> 07:10.660
I freaked out a little when 
it popped up out of nowhere,

07:10.660 --> 07:12.840
but I think this is gonna go pretty well!

07:12.840 --> 07:14.450
All right! Next!

07:14.450 --> 07:15.950
Go!

07:17.420 --> 07:18.760
Take that!

07:34.370 --> 07:35.600
H-Hey, wait!

07:38.700 --> 07:40.060
Wait!

07:42.550 --> 07:44.710
They ran away again.

07:44.710 --> 07:47.540
Must be because I can't move fast...

07:47.540 --> 07:49.280
Is there anything I can use?

07:49.280 --> 07:50.860
Wh-What is this?!

07:51.140 --> 07:53.990
Buffs? Debuffs? When did I get these?!

07:54.570 --> 07:58.070
Oh, is this the "gimmick" 
they were talking about?

07:58.070 --> 08:00.290
So what I've got right now is...

08:00.290 --> 08:03.370
Presence of Power

08:00.290 --> 08:03.370
All monsters below a certain level run away from the player.

08:00.290 --> 08:03.370
Conditions for Acquisition

08:00.290 --> 08:03.370
Defeat a set number of monsters in the preliminary round of the eighth event.

08:00.290 --> 08:03.370
It makes monsters... run away?!

08:05.700 --> 08:07.930
Wait up!

08:12.030 --> 08:13.690
I can't catch up to them!

08:13.690 --> 08:15.300
Turtle...

08:21.820 --> 08:23.620
What's this thing?

08:25.690 --> 08:29.150
It's not running away, so 
I guess it's not a monster.

08:39.460 --> 08:42.980
Oh, it's a trap that 
draws monsters toward it!

08:42.980 --> 08:44.870
But right now, that's a lucky break for me!

08:44.870 --> 08:47.380
All right! Syrup!

08:47.380 --> 08:49.020
[Red Flower Garden]!

08:49.020 --> 08:50.600
[White Flower Garden]!

08:50.600 --> 08:52.090
[Sinking Earth]!

08:52.090 --> 08:53.300
[Mother Nature]!

08:53.300 --> 08:54.840
Turtle!

09:02.470 --> 09:04.020
Yes!

09:04.020 --> 09:05.940
[Deploy Right Hand]!

09:16.220 --> 09:20.290
This one reveals my 
location to other players?

09:20.290 --> 09:22.330
Uh... I guess that's okay?

09:28.330 --> 09:32.190
Thanks, Tsukimi! With your help, 
I'm actually hanging in there!

09:32.190 --> 09:33.170
Bear!

09:33.720 --> 09:36.180
I wonder how Yui and Yukimi are doing...

09:38.700 --> 09:40.510
I found you, kitten!

09:40.620 --> 09:43.890
Our brotherly bond brought us together...

09:43.970 --> 09:45.470
...and now we've found you!

09:45.470 --> 09:47.390
What an unlucky girl you are!

09:47.390 --> 09:50.860
We'll finish you in one blow, baby.

09:50.860 --> 09:52.650
Tsukimi, let's go!

09:52.650 --> 09:54.820
[Power Share]! [Charge]!

09:55.910 --> 09:56.790
Bear!

09:56.790 --> 09:57.630
Bear!

09:57.630 --> 09:58.860
[Bright Star]!

09:58.860 --> 10:00.240
Bear!

10:00.240 --> 10:03.450
A fine attack! Amore!

10:04.970 --> 10:07.150
T-Tactical retreat!

10:07.150 --> 10:11.210
H-Hey! You're leaving both 
your older brothers behind?!

10:11.210 --> 10:13.090
Tsukimi! [Tear Apart]!

10:14.490 --> 10:15.460
Bear!

10:16.790 --> 10:18.550
B-Bro!

10:18.550 --> 10:20.510
W-Well, since I have the chance...

10:20.510 --> 10:22.390
I'm running, too!

10:23.370 --> 10:24.590
We pulled through somehow.

10:24.590 --> 10:27.540
Thanks, Tsukimi! You're really strong!

10:27.540 --> 10:29.190
Bear!

10:29.190 --> 10:30.850
Sis!

10:30.850 --> 10:31.930
Yui!

10:31.930 --> 10:34.070
I'm so glad I found you!

10:34.070 --> 10:35.900
How's it been going for you?

10:35.900 --> 10:38.440
Great, thanks to Yukimi! Right?

10:38.440 --> 10:39.600
Bear!

10:39.600 --> 10:41.030
Anyway, did you see this?

10:41.620 --> 10:43.120
Huh? That's Maple!

10:43.120 --> 10:46.120
Seems so. And it looks like 
they're all after her.

10:46.120 --> 10:47.490
Should we go to her?

10:47.490 --> 10:51.660
Yeah. I don't know if we can help her, but...

10:52.590 --> 10:53.540
Iz?

10:54.190 --> 10:57.730
I messaged the others to let them 
know they shouldn't come this way.

10:57.730 --> 10:59.510
All right, let's do this.

10:59.510 --> 11:01.820
Fay, [Forest's Wrath]!

11:06.280 --> 11:07.690
[Strengthen Item]!

11:09.060 --> 11:10.600
[Spirit's Mischief]!

11:12.230 --> 11:14.310
Should be right... here.

11:14.310 --> 11:15.560
And now...

11:17.030 --> 11:19.400
Fay, [String Water]!

11:23.700 --> 11:25.740
Good work, Fay.

11:30.940 --> 11:34.210
Just in case... Fay, [Fairy's Protection].

11:35.570 --> 11:37.390
Okay, here we go!

11:43.450 --> 11:45.180
Wh-What's that?

11:49.210 --> 11:53.400
Is she for real? She's gonna 
blow up the whole forest.

11:53.400 --> 11:57.360
I gotta be careful never to 
miss any messages from Iz.

11:57.360 --> 11:59.680
If I'd been caught up in 
that, I'd be dead meat.

11:59.680 --> 12:00.830
Anyway...

12:05.550 --> 12:08.660
Let's go, Necro! [Armored]!

12:09.510 --> 12:11.450
Necro! [Reflect Impact]!

12:13.330 --> 12:15.000
[Flames of Death]!

12:23.010 --> 12:24.720
Good time to rack up points!

12:25.730 --> 12:27.300
Counting on you, Necro!

12:27.300 --> 12:28.830
[Ghost Charge]!

12:29.720 --> 12:31.300
[Burst Flame]!

12:35.060 --> 12:39.580
Whew. Appreciate the moment of 
respite after I was surrounded.

12:39.940 --> 12:42.160
Okay, time for one last rush!

12:42.160 --> 12:43.900
Let's do this, Necro!

12:43.900 --> 12:52.410
Bear... Bear... Bear...

12:46.100 --> 12:48.660
All the enemies should be focusing on Maple!

12:49.120 --> 12:51.550
We have to at least try to help her!

13:01.210 --> 13:04.520
Well, for now...

13:04.520 --> 13:05.810
...let's just leave her be.

13:05.810 --> 13:06.420
Yeah.

13:15.350 --> 13:17.950
Sorry, but I'm not gonna show any mercy.

13:17.950 --> 13:19.610
Earth! [Awaken]!

13:21.070 --> 13:24.090
If you can take out even 
one rival, do it, right?

13:24.090 --> 13:25.900
Shadow, [Awaken]!

13:26.910 --> 13:29.600
I might be at a bit of a disadvantage here.

13:29.600 --> 13:31.160
[Wood Wall]!

13:31.160 --> 13:32.990
Earth! [Sand King]!

13:37.210 --> 13:38.580
[Fissure]!

13:42.050 --> 13:43.550
[Firestorm]!

13:44.130 --> 13:45.880
Shadow! [Shadow Dive]!

13:49.810 --> 13:51.140
[Shadow Clone]!

13:52.060 --> 13:54.040
Shadow! [Shadow Pack]!

14:04.480 --> 14:06.190
[Triple Slash]!

14:16.790 --> 14:18.710
That was a little too easy.

14:18.710 --> 14:21.200
Guess that's what happens 
when it's two-on-one, though.

14:21.200 --> 14:22.630
What's up?

14:22.630 --> 14:26.890
Oh, nothing. We did see the death effect.

14:26.890 --> 14:28.660
I was worrying over nothing.

14:28.660 --> 14:30.590
Let's go, Shadow and Drag.

14:30.590 --> 14:34.650
I'm not your tame monster! Jeez!

14:34.650 --> 14:36.810
Right, on to the next one!

14:38.050 --> 14:39.710
That was a close one.

14:39.710 --> 14:42.230
Guess there was no way 
I was winning that one.

14:42.230 --> 14:44.020
You did great, though, Sou.

14:44.380 --> 14:47.940
Thanks to [Division] and 
[Mimic], we didn't lose anyone.

14:47.940 --> 14:51.770
And I got to see their tame monsters, 
so it was a productive battle.

14:54.410 --> 14:56.500
Those two were pretty strong.

14:56.500 --> 14:59.030
It won't turn out this way next time, though.

15:00.210 --> 15:02.670
Wh-What is with this forest?

15:02.670 --> 15:06.380
I'm just going in circles. When 
am I gonna get out of here?

15:09.370 --> 15:11.570
I-I can't move!

15:11.570 --> 15:12.220
[Flash]!

15:17.370 --> 15:20.520
[Super Megamorph] is definitely 
nice to have on my side.

15:21.530 --> 15:24.200
I sense something over there. Let's go!

15:26.610 --> 15:27.890
Here it comes!

15:27.890 --> 15:29.280
Yes, Sister!

15:29.490 --> 15:30.650
[Blood Blade]!

15:35.080 --> 15:36.450
Wh-What was that?!

15:37.950 --> 15:39.410
S-Sister!

15:49.010 --> 15:51.220
Snake-ake-ake-ake...

15:52.720 --> 15:55.220
This is our territory.

15:55.570 --> 15:57.990
All who enter it will be cut down.

15:57.990 --> 15:59.150
Right, Haku?

15:59.150 --> 16:00.060
Snake.

16:02.930 --> 16:05.180
I wonder how everyone else is doing.

16:06.690 --> 16:10.240
Looks like Maple's been in 
the same place for a while...

16:11.100 --> 16:12.490
Is that Mii?

16:12.490 --> 16:14.680
Well, there's not much time left.

16:15.000 --> 16:17.080
Might as well check into it 
while I scout things out.

16:17.450 --> 16:20.140
Thank you for sending that message, Iz.

16:20.140 --> 16:22.410
It was as beautiful as a fireworks show!

16:23.180 --> 16:25.100
Maybe I overdid it a bit...

16:25.100 --> 16:28.100
But the point is to make 
sure we all rank high!

16:28.100 --> 16:30.800
That was way beyond fireworks, though.

16:30.800 --> 16:32.280
Have you heard from any of the others?

16:32.280 --> 16:33.670
Not really.

16:33.670 --> 16:37.590
Though I'm sure Sally and 
Kanade are holding their own.

16:37.590 --> 16:38.780
And Maple...

16:39.470 --> 16:41.220
She's not moving.

16:41.220 --> 16:43.270
It seemed like some kind of trap.

16:43.270 --> 16:45.730
Yeah, like a boss dungeon...

16:45.730 --> 16:48.070
Well, I'm sure she's handling it.

16:50.570 --> 16:54.030
I've used a lot of my skills. 
What should I do now?

16:54.030 --> 16:57.330
I think I'm good on points now.

16:57.330 --> 17:00.660
I'd love to do some exploring 
since I'm here, but...

17:02.350 --> 17:05.170
Ooh, looks like I might see a good show here.

17:07.380 --> 17:09.590
I didn't expect you to show up.

17:09.830 --> 17:12.060
I've hunted more than enough monsters.

17:12.790 --> 17:15.340
All that's left is to find 
out how strong my rivals are.

17:15.340 --> 17:19.230
What a coincidence. I was 
just thinking the same thing.

17:19.830 --> 17:20.850
[Heavy Fire]!

17:20.850 --> 17:22.310
[Sword of Radiance]!

17:24.450 --> 17:26.450
Ignis, [Linked Flame]!

17:26.450 --> 17:28.400
Ray, [Holy Dragon's Protection]!

17:32.570 --> 17:34.030
[Flare Accel]!

17:39.240 --> 17:40.270
[Blue Fire]!

17:40.270 --> 17:41.850
[Sword of Demon Extermination]!

17:41.850 --> 17:42.770
[Inferno]!

17:42.770 --> 17:44.200
[Holy Light]!

17:44.200 --> 17:46.110
Ignis! [Megamorph]!

17:46.430 --> 17:47.460
[Undying Inferno]!

17:47.460 --> 17:49.110
Ray! [Megamorph]!

17:49.110 --> 17:50.590
[Holy Dragon's Breath]!

17:54.300 --> 17:56.760
I see. That's a fine monster.

17:56.760 --> 17:58.630
As is your dragon.

17:58.630 --> 17:59.390
But...

17:59.790 --> 18:03.850
If you're concealing your strength, 
you will be burned to ash!

18:03.850 --> 18:06.390
Ignis! [Phoenix Flame]!

18:06.740 --> 18:08.430
[Become Fire]!

18:15.940 --> 18:17.060
Oh?

18:18.240 --> 18:19.570
[Infierno]!

18:21.910 --> 18:23.740
Ray! [Holy Guard]!

18:32.790 --> 18:36.350
You took all that with damage reduction 
and the power of your holy sword?

18:36.710 --> 18:39.630
I'm sure you would've 
liked to see Ray's attack,

18:39.980 --> 18:43.100
but I can't just hand over 
<i>that</i> much information.

18:43.100 --> 18:46.710
You had no intention of defeating 
me from the start, eh?

18:46.710 --> 18:49.100
Still, don't expect me to let 
you leave here unscathed.

18:50.070 --> 18:51.860
Stop me if you think you can.

18:56.510 --> 18:59.610
Go! Go! Go!

19:03.740 --> 19:05.500
That's it!

19:06.680 --> 19:09.460
M-Maple?!

19:09.460 --> 19:12.570
This is so cool!

19:12.570 --> 19:15.420
I bet I could keep going forever!

19:20.810 --> 19:22.700
Yay!

19:23.800 --> 19:25.280
I've lost interest.

19:25.280 --> 19:28.260
Payne, let's resume this battle another time.

19:28.260 --> 19:30.810
Yeah! That's it!

19:28.270 --> 19:30.420
Yes, I agree.

19:31.310 --> 19:33.480
Oh, that way? Cool!

19:37.610 --> 19:40.490
What the heck are you doing, Maple?

19:45.020 --> 19:46.210
Maple!

19:46.540 --> 19:47.660
What are you doing?!

19:47.660 --> 19:48.660
Sally?

19:49.010 --> 19:53.120
Wait 'til you hear the story! 
This alligator ate me,

19:53.120 --> 19:56.140
but I couldn't get into its stomach...

19:56.140 --> 19:57.840
You really don't <i>need</i> to get in there.

19:57.840 --> 20:00.520
So I tried some stuff, and 
this is how I ended up!

20:00.520 --> 20:02.300
Okay. I'm lost.

20:02.300 --> 20:05.110
Check it out! When I go this way...

20:05.110 --> 20:06.790
And when I go this way...

20:08.020 --> 20:09.960
And when I do this...

20:12.270 --> 20:14.850
It actually controls really well!

20:14.850 --> 20:15.480
Huh...

20:15.480 --> 20:17.440
And I can use my laser...

20:17.440 --> 20:20.280
to hunt monsters! Two birds with one stone!

20:20.280 --> 20:23.990
Oh, I looked at the map a minute ago, 
and it said Mii was around here.

20:23.990 --> 20:25.950
Did I run past her?

20:25.950 --> 20:29.240
Hey! Did you see my gator?

20:27.050 --> 20:30.200
